Cell["\<\
A 3-array has no flat picture of its own, so it is drawn as a row of \
matrices, the first index choosing the matrix:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"21f04683-2993-5e48-a14a-44a6fbaf0c0d"],

Cell["ArrayGraphics[Array[#1 + #2 + #3 &, {2, 2, 2}]]", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"f27f39a0-07b1-654a-8ad1-5b4131b8a63b"],

